{"id":"f748d191ce42f6ef","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-open-provability-formula.md","title":"Provability of Numeral Instances","display":"df-open-provability-formula — Provability of Numeral Instances","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-open-provability-formula","aliases":["89-df-open-provability-formula"],"display":"df-open-provability-formula — Provability of Numeral Instances","depends_on":["[[89-df-provability-predicate]]","[[89-df-arithmetical-language]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-open-provability-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-open-provability-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-open-provability-formula — Provability of Numeral Instances"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"841985de31202f85\" href=\"?note=841985de31202f85\" title=\"89-df-provability-predicate\">89-df-provability-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a257e5b1de6880b7\" href=\"?note=a257e5b1de6880b7\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-language\">89-df-arithmetical-language</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(\\bar x)\">\\(\\varphi(\\bar x)\\)</span> 是算术公式，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar x=(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\">\\(\\bar x=(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\\)</span> 按指标递增列出全部自由变元，无重复。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_\\varphi:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(g_\\varphi:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 计算把各 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_i\">\\(x_i\\)</span> 同时代入对应数词后的闭句码。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_\\varphi(\\bar x,y)\">\\(G_\\varphi(\\bar x,y)\\)</span> 是该原始递归函数的固定图表示，PA 证明其总性唯一性；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 及证明量词变元先改名避免捕获。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 是固定算术公理集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span> 是其对象可证性公式；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bew}[\\varphi]\">\\(\\mathrm{Bew}[\\varphi]\\)</span> 是下面定义的开放实例可证性公式缩写。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}open\\text{-}provability\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Bew}[\\varphi](\\bar x)\\coloneqq\n\\exists y\\,(G_\\varphi(\\bar x,y)\\land\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(y)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}open\\text{-}provability\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Bew}[\\varphi](\\bar x)\\coloneqq\n\\exists y\\,(G_\\varphi(\\bar x,y)\\land\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(y)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 2 章，印刷页 45–46；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 17 章，印刷页 219–220；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=0\">\\(k=0\\)</span>，它等价于通常 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k&gt;0\">\\(k&gt;0\\)</span>，表示每个数值赋值下对应数词实例的可证性，不是把开放 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 的恒定语法码直接代入 Prov。编码操作取可证明总的标准图表示，确保保留显示参数并允许量词与盒交错。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"841985de31202f85","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-provability-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-language","status":"resolved","id":"a257e5b1de6880b7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-language]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\varphi(\\bar x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar x=(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)","display":false},{"tex":"g_\\varphi:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"x_i","display":false},{"tex":"G_\\varphi(\\bar x,y)","display":false},{"tex":"y","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Bew}[\\varphi]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}open\\text{-}provability\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Bew}[\\varphi](\\bar x)\\coloneqq\n\\exists y\\,(G_\\varphi(\\bar x,y)\\land\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(y)).","display":true},{"tex":"k=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"k>0","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false}],"bytes":1853,"backlinks":[{"id":"ee07d81809d76030","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"3b78fd5923bcaa6c","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-70","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-open-provability-formula]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-183","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-qml-formula]] → [[89-df-open-provability-formula]] → [[89-df-qml-realization]] → [[89-df-qml-validity-sets]] → [[89-df-relative-completeness]] → [[89-thm-qml-complexity]] → [[89-cor-qml-not-axiomatizable]]"}],"outgoing":["841985de31202f85","a257e5b1de6880b7"]}